5,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10309,"speakerName":"翰学","textMapHash":2655527098,"text":"この方は岩王帝君の力を甘く見ているようでな、プロの考古学者として少し訂正してあげていたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[110200206,110200207]},{"nodeId":110200206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3264123978,"text":"実は彼…","nextNodeIds":[110200208]},{"nodeId":110200208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10309,"speakerName":"翰学","textMapHash":3935008346,"text":"ちょうど今、「世界最初のモラ」の話をしていたところだよ。","nextNodeIds":[110200209]},{"nodeId":110200209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1852284626,"text":"世界最初のモラ？","nextNodeIds":[110200210]},{"nodeId":110200210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10308,"speakerName":"逸軒","textMapHash":1547461162,"text":"岩王帝君の導きにより先人たちは鉱石を製錬し、諸国と貿易を展開したのは誰もが知っているだろう。","nextNodeIds":[110200211]},{"nodeId":110200211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10308,"speakerName":"逸軒","textMapHash":710196586,"text":"今の璃月には全大陸で唯一モラを製造できる権利がある。そして最初のモラは、数千年前に岩王帝君が作ったと考えられる。","nextNodeIds":[110200212]},{"nodeId":110200212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10303,"speakerName":"宛煙","textMapHash":3806605578,"text":"アタシの考察…それから推測だと、この歴史的意味のあるモラは「記念品」として今も大事に保存されてると思うわ。","nextNodeIds":[110200213]},{"nodeId":110200213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10303,"speakerName":"宛煙","textMapHash":1211302882,"text":"例えば…璃月を管理する「七星」は、就任前に秘密裏に行われる儀式があって、そこで…","nextNodeIds":[110200214]},{"nodeId":110200214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10309,"speakerName":"翰学","textMapHash":757186906,"text":"いやいや、私の研究だとこの「最初のモラ」はそう単純なものではない。","nextNodeIds":[110200215]},{"nodeId":110200215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10309,"speakerName":"翰学","textMapHash":1134857658,"text":"ご存知の通り、モラは触媒のひとつである。今もモラを使って武器を強化する術が存在する。","nextNodeIds":[110200216]},{"nodeId":110200216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10309,"speakerName":"翰学","textMapHash":2944440778,"text":"世界最初のモラには強い力が秘められているはずだ。だから、今度出す私の本でこの10年間の研究成果を証明してみせようと思っている！","nextNodeIds":[110200217]},{"nodeId":110200217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10309,"speakerName":"翰学","textMapHash":2515079474,"text":"ずばり——岩王帝君はそのモラを使って、刀と剣を強化したという歴史を。","nextNodeIds":[110200218]},{"nodeId":110200218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2184217154,"text":"刀と剣を？","nextNodeIds":[110200219]},{"nodeId":110200219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10309,"speakerName":"翰学","textMapHash":3423058130,"text":"ハハッ、知りたければ私の本を買うといい。ちなみに、その刀と剣を手に入れれば璃月の王になれると言われ——","nextNodeIds":[110200220]},{"nodeId":110200220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":2100077778,"text":"…それはどうだろうか。","nextNodeIds":[110200221]},{"nodeId":110200221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10309,"speakerName":"翰学","textMapHash":3775479402,"text":"おや？","nextNodeIds":[110200222]},{"nodeId":110200222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":1951204938,"text":"刀剣の真相の考察は置いておくとして…モラが生まれた理由は、「契約」を結ぶための手段だ。","nextNodeIds":[110200223]},{"nodeId":110200223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":1435035890,"text":"モラを使って取引させることこそが、本意だと思う。","nextNodeIds":[110200224]},{"nodeId":110200224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":1591938962,"text":"だから「最初のモラ」も、普通に通貨として使われているだろう…","nextNodeIds":[110200225]},{"nodeId":110200225,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10308,"speakerName":"逸軒","textMapHash":4015499794,"text":"ふむ…私は翰学殿の仮説は面白いと思う。逆に鍾離殿、なぜ証拠もなしに否定を？","nextNodeIds":[110200226]},{"nodeId":110200226,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":4203227642,"text":"いや…俺はあくまで事実を述べたまでだ。","nextNodeIds":[110200227]},{"nodeId":110200227,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10309,"speakerName":"翰学","textMapHash":3152563290,"text":"私よりも岩王帝君の御心が分かると言うのかい？","nextNodeIds":[110200228,110200229]},{"nodeId":110200228,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3749739242,"text":"実は彼…","nextNodeIds":[110200230]},{"nodeId":110200230,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":366469962,"text":"歴史に関しては俺も詳しくはない。だが、意見が分かれなければ切磋琢磨もできなくなる。","nextNodeIds":[110200231]},{"nodeId":110200231,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10308,"speakerName":"逸軒","textMapHash":3071131706,"text":"では聞こう。千年前、岩王帝君が先人たちに建築の技術を教えた。その時、使われた模型は全てモラで鋳造されたものだった、そうだね？","nextNodeIds":[110200232]},{"nodeId":110200232,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":1113316386,"text":"その通りだ。","nextNodeIds":[110200233]},{"nodeId":110200233,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10309,"speakerName":"翰学","textMapHash":1095434370,"text":"では、仮にモラに神力がないとして、なぜ岩王帝君はそんな贅沢なことをしたのだ？","nextNodeIds":[110200234]},{"nodeId":110200234,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":3543532530,"text":"簡単だ。それはモラが最も手に入りやすく、最もコストのかからない材料だったからだろう。","nextNodeIds":[110200235]},{"nodeId":110200235,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10309,"speakerName":"翰学","textMapHash":2800060562,"text":"うっ、うーん…","nextNodeIds":[110200236]},{"nodeId":110200236,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4027153698,"text":"他人事みたいに言うんだね。","nextNodeIds":[110200237]},{"nodeId":110200237,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":99008098,"text":"ハハッ、岩王帝君の話だからな。","nextNodeIds":[110200238]},{"nodeId":110200238,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10303,"speakerName":"宛煙","textMapHash":1676683586,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[110200239]},{"nodeId":110200239,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10303,"speakerName":"宛煙","textMapHash":2008941554,"text":"鍾離殿！その…考古学に関してあなたに聞きたいことがあるんだけど、場所を変えて聞いてもいいかしら？","nextNodeIds":[110200240]},{"nodeId":110200240,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":2325785834,"text":"#ああ、構わないが、友人も一緒でいいか？{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_HE|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_SHE]}はきっと力になると思うぞ。","nextNodeIds":[110200241,110200242]},{"nodeId":110200241,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1602939522,"text":"いいの？","nextNodeIds":[110200243]},{"nodeId":110200243,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10303,"speakerName":"宛煙","textMapHash":2202666690,"text":"ぜひご一緒してほしいわ！さあ、行きましょう。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":110200242,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2969254738,"text":"何やらいろいろ聞けそうだ。","nextNodeIds":[110200243]},{"nodeId":110200229,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":474790834,"text":"彼より分かる人はいないかと…","nextNodeIds":[110200230]},{"nodeId":110200207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4166461994,"text":"彼より分かる人はいないかと…","nextNodeIds":[110200208]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1102002,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["10232"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":1102003,"order":3,"stepDescription":"船尾に行って宛煙の問題を聞く","stepDescTextMapHash":2217512356,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1102003,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB