":[{"nodeId":110200301,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10303,"speakerName":"宛煙","textMapHash":141981954,"text":"これから話すことは、少し岩神に対して不敬だから…人の少ない場所の方がいいと思ってね。","nextNodeIds":[110200302]},{"nodeId":110200302,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10303,"speakerName":"宛煙","textMapHash":3947460930,"text":"鍾離殿の話は理に適っていた。多数の意見になびくことなく、非常に客観的だったわ。","nextNodeIds":[110200303]},{"nodeId":110200303,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10303,"speakerName":"宛煙","textMapHash":345221898,"text":"だから、他の学者とは違う答えがもらえるかと思って…鍾離殿、岩神に殺された魔神はみんな悪だったと思う？","nextNodeIds":[110200304]},{"nodeId":110200304,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":4022250466,"text":"…善悪はさておき、岩王帝君は「契約」を尊ぶ。だから殺された魔神はきっと「契約」を反故にしたはずだ。","nextNodeIds":[110200305]},{"nodeId":110200305,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4239602682,"text":"おう、罪もないやつを殺すなんてこと、岩王帝君はしないと思うぞ。","nextNodeIds":[110200306]},{"nodeId":110200306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10303,"speakerName":"宛煙","textMapHash":755735482,"text":"でも、考古学の研究をしていく中で「塩の魔神」に関する伝説を耳にしたわ。","nextNodeIds":[110200307]},{"nodeId":110200307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10303,"speakerName":"宛煙","textMapHash":4061490730,"text":"「塩の魔神」ヘウリア…彼女は善良な魔神だった。でも戦争でモラクスに…","nextNodeIds":[110200308]},{"nodeId":110200308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10303,"speakerName":"宛煙","textMapHash":2518015554,"text":"モラクスに、実に不名誉な方法で…暗殺された。","nextNodeIds":[110200309]},{"nodeId":110200309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":755752554,"text":"えっ？嘘だろ！","nextNodeIds":[110200310]},{"nodeId":110200310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":3171980474,"text":"…それは話せば長くなるな。真相もお前の知りたいものではないかもしれない。","nextNodeIds":[110200311]},{"nodeId":110200311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10303,"speakerName":"宛煙","textMapHash":1715520162,"text":"構わないわ、知ってることを教えて欲しいの！ずっと…ずっとこの件を調べてきたから！","nextNodeIds":[110200312,110200314]},{"nodeId":110200312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2190778954,"text":"鍾離先生、少し困ってるみたいだ。","nextNodeIds":[110200313]},{"nodeId":110200313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":278276906,"text":"いや…ただ、どこから話せばいいか。","nextNodeIds":[110200316]},{"nodeId":110200316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10302,"speakerName":"クリメント","textMapHash":3909372114,"text":"おっ、いたいた！鍾離先生！探したぞ。","nextNodeIds":[110200317,110200318]},{"nodeId":110200317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2060804378,"text":"ファデュイ！？","nextNodeIds":[110200319]},{"nodeId":110200319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3249187258,"text":"武器を降ろせ！離れろ！…千岩軍に通報するぞ！","nextNodeIds":[110200320]},{"nodeId":110200320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10302,"speakerName":"クリメント","textMapHash":3143664258,"text":"武器なんか持ってないんだが！？","nextNodeIds":[110200321]},{"nodeId":110200321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10302,"speakerName":"クリメント","textMapHash":2243224034,"text":"な、なあ…落ち着いてくれ、俺はスネージナヤから来たただの考古学研究員だ。","nextNodeIds":[110200322]},{"nodeId":110200322,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4233313410,"text":"ファデュイは信じないぞ…","nextNodeIds":[110200323]},{"nodeId":110200323,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10302,"speakerName":"クリメント","textMapHash":2173249074,"text":"ちゃんと璃月総務司にも報告したし、正式な許可書類も持ってる。","nextNodeIds":[110200324]},{"nodeId":110200324,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10302,"speakerName":"クリメント","textMapHash":3666565970,"text":"これから璃月で考古学調査を行い、その調査結果を全て総務司にも共有することになっている。","nextNodeIds":[110200325]},{"nodeId":110200325,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10302,"speakerName":"クリメント","textMapHash":2009805802,"text":"それで、往生堂の鍾離先生は物知りだと聞いて、俺の顧問になってほしく往生堂に大金を支払ったんだ。","nextNodeIds":[110200326]},{"nodeId":110200326,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":2892162098,"text":"つまりは往生堂の仕事、だな。","nextNodeIds":[110200327,110200328]},{"nodeId":110200327,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3934146370,"text":"どうする？","nextNodeIds":[110200329]},{"nodeId":110200329,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":2110220746,"text":"仕事なら仕方ないさ。往生堂には世話になっているからな。","nextNodeIds":[110200330]},{"nodeId":110200330,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10302,"speakerName":"クリメント","textMapHash":1115252586,"text":"さすが鍾離先生！じゃあ今すぐ出発しようか！","nextNodeIds":[110200331]},{"nodeId":110200331,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10303,"speakerName":"宛煙","textMapHash":454643722,"text":"待って、アタシもついてっていい？アタシも考古学者だから役に立てるわ。","nextNodeIds":[110200332]},{"nodeId":110200332,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":3936443450,"text":"#では先ほどの話はまた後にしよう。そうだ、{NICKNAME}、お前も一緒に来い。","nextNodeIds":[110200333,110200334]},{"nodeId":110200333,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3698461410,"text":"どうして？","nextNodeIds":[110200335]},{"nodeId":110200335,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":1521668922,"text":"この先の経験はお前の力になるかもしれない。","nextNodeIds":[110200336]},{"nodeId":110200336,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":1331867154,"text":"あれは七神が確立される前のこと…魔神はもういないし、お前の目標でもないが、お前の旅に少しは意味をもたらすと思うぞ。","nextNodeIds":[110200337]},{"nodeId":110200337,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10302,"speakerName":"クリメント","textMapHash":2870855866,"text":"待て、これは観光じゃなくて考古学チームだ！人が多すぎる！","nextNodeIds":[110200338]},{"nodeId":110200338,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":2683914354,"text":"しかし、俺の友人には唯一無二の才能がある、かなり役に立つと思うぞ。","nextNodeIds":[110200339]},{"nodeId":110200339,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10302,"speakerName":"クリメント","textMapHash":2998669298,"text":"へえ？どんな才能だ？","nextNodeIds":[110200340]},{"nodeId":110200340,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":137001666,"text":"——宝箱を絶対に見逃さないという才能だ。","nextNodeIds":[110200341]},{"nodeId":110200341,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":258950226,"text":"オイラも得意だぞ！","nextNodeIds":[110200342]},{"nodeId":110200342,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10302,"speakerName":"クリメント","textMapHash":2468121362,"text":"…確かに役に立つなぁ、許可しよう。","nextNodeIds":[110200343]},{"nodeId":110200343,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10302,"speakerName":"クリメント","textMapHash":1140610714,"text":"では早速、例の「渦の魔神」が群玉閣によって鎮圧された場所を見に行こう。何かあるかもしれない。","nextNodeIds":[110200344]},{"nodeId":110200344,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10302,"speakerName":"クリメント","textMapHash":2454612154,"text":"古物や痕跡、魔神の欠片があればもっといい…とにかく、きっと何かしら収穫はあるはずだ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":110200334,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":606101914,"text":"考古学はよく分からないけど。","nextNodeIds":[110200335]},{"nodeId":110200328,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4080159370,"text":"慎重になった方がいいと思う。","nextNodeIds":[110200329]},{"nodeId":110200318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4034341642,"text":"止まれ！","nextNodeIds":[110200319]},{"nodeId":110200314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":692484954,"text":"複雑な話なの？","nextNodeIds":[110200315]},{"nodeId":110200315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":523192770,"text":"ああ、どこから話せばいいか迷っている。","nextNodeIds":[110200316]}]},{"talkId":1102004,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NON